  "solution": "**Given:- **\n\n(x - 5)² + (x + 3)² + 4x\n\n**Formula used:-**\n\n( A + B )² = A² + B² + 2AB \n\n( A - B)² = A² + B² - 2AB\n\n**Calculation:-** \n\n⇒ (x - 5)2 = x² + 25 - 10x --------(1)\n\n⇒ (x + 3)2 = x² + 9 + 6x --------(2)\n\n⇒ 4x = 4x -----(3) \n\nAdding equation(1) (2) & (3) \n\n⇒ (x - 5)2 + (x + 3)2 + 4x \n\n⇒ x2 + 25 - 10x + x2 + 9 + 6x + 4x \n\n⇒ 2x2 + 34 = 2 (x2 + 17) \n\n**∴ The required answer is 2(x2 + 17).**",
